    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαν-ίημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remit</i> or <i>relax a little,</i>
			
